+---
+id: dl-001-task-ids-are-per-list-counters-resolved-before-titles
+type: decision-log
+title: "Task ids are per-list counters, resolved before titles"
+status: pending
+---
+
+<!-- decision-log body. `wingfoil memory add` copies this scaffold verbatim; `memory submit` replaces
+     these placeholder comments with real content and fills the required frontmatter fields. -->
+
+## Context
+Tasks need an identifier that survives renames. `src/domain/` may not use the clock or randomness (r3).
+
+## Decision
+Ids are `task-<n>` from a counter private to each list; a number is never reused, even after `remove`.
+When a title-taking method gets a string, an id match wins over a title match.
+
+## Consequences
+Ids are deterministic but only unique within one list. A task whose title equals another task's id is
+reachable by id only through that id, never by that title.
