+Added `id` to `Task`, assigned by the list on `add`; added `TaskList.get(id)`; `find`, `complete`,
+`reopen`, `rename`, `tag`, `untag` and `remove` accept an id as well as a title. Tests in
+`test/list.test.ts` (`task ids`). Rename's duplicate check now compares with the found task's title.
